              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">b8af2cc5-1820-422d-a1b0-79193c7661e2</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STB sample: parametric 2-story steel frame (based on data/building_2f_x1y2.dat)

- X Span / X Count: bay length and number of bays along X
- Y Span 1, Y Span 2: bay lengths along Y. Y Count &gt; 0 repeats them (9.0, 3.2, 9.0, ...)
- Story H1, H2: story heights. Stories &gt; 0 repeats them
- Loads: floor 10 kN/m2 (LC0, base level included), wall 2 kN/m2 on Y faces (LC1), self weight (LC0)
- Turn 'Run' on to analyze. 'LC' picks the load case for the result previews.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
